    "group": "Spectacle of Spite",
    "cp": 1,
    "summary": "Spend 1 CP as your Movement phase or your Charge phase begins, on a WYCH CULT unit of yours. For the rest of the phase, whenever it makes a Charge, Advance or Normal move, you may disregard any modifiers you choose to its Advance rolls, its Charge rolls and its Move characteristic. In addition, until the turn ends, its models can move horizontally through other models during such moves; they may pass into those models' Engagement Range but cannot end an Advance move or Normal move inside it.",
